 ## Getting Started
 
 ### Prerequisites
-- Xilinx Vivado 2019.1
-- cmake 3.0 or higher
+- Xilinx Vivado 2018.1
+- License for Xilinx 10G MAC IP
+- Linux OS
 
 Supported boards (out of the box)
 - Xilinx VC709
